{"type":"assistant","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The problem was in `truncate_slug` in `repo/slug.py`. Report URLs are built from hyphenated titles and then cut to a max length. A plain slice at that length could stop right after a hyphen, so you’d get slugs like `my-report-` instead of `my-report`.\n\nThe function’s docstring already described the intended behavior; the implementation just returned `text[:limit]` without cleaning up the end.\n\n**Fix:** after truncating, strip trailing hyphens with `.rstrip(\"-\")`. For example, `\"my-report-title\"` with limit 10 becomes `\"my-report\"` instead of `\"my-report-\"`.\n\nThat helper is used by `old_slugify` and `slug_summary` in `rows.py`, so both paths get the same behavior. All slug tests pass."}]},"session_id":"2314c8f3-1e60-48c4-b2c9-eba7d374b277"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","duration_ms":19426,"duration_api_ms":19426,"is_error":false,"result":"Searching the codebase for where report URL slugs are generated.\n\n\nThe bug is in `truncate_slug`: it slices at the limit and can leave a trailing hyphen. Fixing it to strip trailing hyphens after truncation.\n\n\nThe problem was in `truncate_slug` in `repo/slug.py`. Report URLs are built from hyphenated titles and then cut to a max length. A plain slice at that length could stop right after a hyphen, so you’d get slugs like `my-report-` instead of `my-report`.\n\nThe function’s docstring already described the intended behavior; the implementation just returned `text[:limit]` without cleaning up the end.\n\n**Fix:** after truncating, strip trailing hyphens with `.rstrip(\"-\")`. For example, `\"my-report-title\"` with limit 10 becomes `\"my-report\"` instead of `\"my-report-\"`.\n\nThat helper is used by `old_slugify` and `slug_summary` in `rows.py`, so both paths get the same behavior. All slug tests pass.","session_id":"2314c8f3-1e60-48c4-b2c9-eba7d374b277","request_id":"1ae5d932-efae-47a1-aa73-828b4ea83463","usage":{"inputTokens":11054,"outputTokens":1098,"cacheReadTokens":46976,"cacheWriteTokens":0}}
